  "subject": "feat(core): expose metadata of widgets (#4604)",
  "bodyLines": [
    "* feat(core): expose widgetParams to the head on crawler\r",
    "\r",
    "when the user agent of the crawler is detected a meta tag is added to the document head with the widget parameters for the added widgets.\r",
    "\r",
